---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Me | Foysal Abdullah">
  <main class="container" style="padding-top: 140px; max-width: 800px;">
    <div class="glass-panel" style="padding: 50px;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 30px;">About <span class="gradient-text">Me</span></h1>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8;">
        <p>I'm <strong>Foysal Abdullah</strong>. I started Motion Design and Video editing at the age of 19. Now I'm almost 21.</p>
        <p>I started with the DaVinci Resolve Free version and then started earning from it. I learned a bit of color grading and work with Fusion nodes, and upgraded to Adobe CC. I started learning Premiere Pro, Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, Figma and After Effects.</p>
        <p>I really enjoy watching SaaS Product/services animation and UI/UX animation, Product/service explainer, and I also blend motion design with live action footage so that I can create talking head videos etc.</p>
        <p>I believe using solo normal software isn't enough, I have to use Programming language to push the limit of the software. So that I can create custom animation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>